      "message": "build(xtask): cargo xtask release ports the release cut cross-platform\n\nscripts/release.ps1's ten phases move into xtask (release.rs, release_bump.rs,\nrelease_pack.rs): preflight with the same refusals (--no-tag never on main, no\ntagging run, RELEASE_NOTES.md section check), the release gate tier run in\nprocess, the workspace version bump in Cargo.toml and Cargo.lock (+ cargo\nupdate -w and the version-lines-only guard), the two release commits, a build\nof the product packages only, the post version check, sign.ps1 and the zip\nstaged like release.yml (NOTICE included) on Windows, installer.ps1 on\n--installer. Linux, macOS and FreeBSD hand packaging to package-*.sh and\nrefuse --installer by name.\n\nThe cut never rebuilds xtask while it runs: the gate is called in process\n(no nested cargo xtask) and the build names -p camcraft-ui/-app/-post.\n\nrelease.ps1 is a thin wrapper forwarding its switches; AGENTS.md release\nstep 2 and the hand-test line name cargo xtask release. PROCESS_VERSION 8.\n\nFixes #749\nFixes #748\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
